<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>HaulTimes</title><link>https://haultimes.com/</link><description>Freight and trucking news for the US and Canada</description><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:41:17 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>Coaldale, Lethbridge County release results of 2-month commercial vehicle inspections</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/coaldale-lethbridge-county-release-results-of-2-month-commercial-vehic-80f7379008/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/coaldale-lethbridge-county-release-results-of-2-month-commercial-vehic-80f7379008/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:21:47 +0000</pubDate><category>Regulations</category><description>Community peace officers in Coaldale and Lethbridge County have released results from a joint round of commercial vehicle safety inspections carried out in September and October. Over those two months, inspectors completed 15 inspections and identified a few problem areas involving brakes, tires, load securement and general vehicle equipment. Coaldale Mayor Jack Van Rijn, in a media release, thanked the two municipalities for working together and said keeping commercial vehicles up to safety standards protects everyone on the roads.</description></item><item><title>Surrey, B.C., orders audit into awarding of truck parking permits</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/surrey-b-c-orders-audit-into-awarding-of-truck-parking-permits-6bda17dfce/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/surrey-b-c-orders-audit-into-awarding-of-truck-parking-permits-6bda17dfce/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:23:22 +0000</pubDate><category>Regulations</category><description>Truck News</description></item><item><title>Déjà vu in Miami as FedEx MD-11 freighter overshoots runway</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/d-j-vu-in-miami-as-fedex-md-11-freighter-overshoots-runway-0a142420a3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haulti