illips, a driver for Melton Truck Lines, as a TCA Highway Angel. Phillips was driving near Lexington, Ky., at about 8:10 a.m. on Aug. 14 when an SUV carrying four young adults rolled several times in front of him. He turned on his emergency lights, pulled over and ran to the wreck, then climbed onto the vehicle, which had landed on its side, to try to reach the occupants.

Two occupants told him they were injured, and the other two had scrapes and bruises. Law enforcement arrived shortly afterward and helped get them out, while Phillips stayed to give officers information. The TCA said nearly 1,500 drivers have been recognized since the program began in 1997, supported by presenting sponsor EpicVue and supporting sponsors DriverFacts and Northland Insurance.</description></item><item><title>Collingwood, Ont., truck inspections yield 14 charges</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/collingwood-ont-truck-inspections-yield-14-charges-256a6c4ec7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/collingwood-ont-truck-inspections-yield-14-charges-256a6c4ec7/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:38:33 +0000</pubDate><category>Regulations</category><description>Truck News</description></item><item><title>USMCA, Trade, and the Character Issue</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/usmca-trade-and-the-character-issue-b7fefbdd3c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/usmca-trade-and-the-character-issue-b7fefbdd3c/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:30:30 +0000</pubDate><category>Cross-Border</category><description>The Dispatch</description></item><item><title>Tuesday Girls Basketball; Chiefs Power Past Truckers Behind Rebounds And Assists</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/tuesday-girls-basketball-chiefs-power-past-truckers-behind-rebounds-an-d235de001c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/tuesday-girls-basketball-chiefs-power-past-truckers-behind-rebounds-an-d235de001c/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:58:23 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>TCH Daily News</description></item><item><title>New US certification system needed for ELDs to shrink growing shadow fleet</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/new-us-certification-system-needed-for-elds-to-shrink-growing-shadow-f-69b81dfdf0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/new-us-certifica